  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ALDO HUDSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aldo Hudson is a freshman guard for Troy University, known for his quick reflexes and impressive performance in the 1998-1999 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TROY UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Troy University is a member of the NCAA Division I and the Sun Belt Conference, where Aldo played as a student-athlete."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF SOUTH ALABAMA JAGUARS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of South Alabama Jaguars are Aldo's arch-rivals in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NCAA DIVISION I MEN'S BASKETBALL LEAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The NCAA Division I men's basketball league is the highest level of competition in college basketball, where Aldo competed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL COLLEGIATE ATHLETIC ASSOCIATION (NCAA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The NCAA is the governing body for college athletics in the United States, overseeing Division I competition."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUN BELT CONFERENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Sun Belt Conference is a collegiate athletic conference in which Troy University participates."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KAREN TOWNSEND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Karen Townsend is Aldo's coach, known for her wisdom and wit, and has praised Aldo's court vision and ability to read the defense."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RACHEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rachel is a towering center for the Trojans, known for her soft touch and mean streak."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0436</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JASMINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jasmine is a speedy shooting guard for the Trojans, known for her flair for the dramatic."</data>
